{
	"Name": "Fertilizer",
	"Description": "Adds a button to the crop field window that turns Fertilizer on for every nearby field growing the same crop. On a fallow field it sets all nearby fields to Fallow and turns Remove Rocks and Fertilizer on. Range is set in the Mods settings menu.",
